[1.08585, "o", "p"]
[1.137174, "o", "y"]
[1.590349, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.656728, "o", "Task: email the customer who spent the most. 4 tools, each a 300 ms API call.\r\n"]
[2.457095, "o", "The model sends ONE run_weave call with this script:\r\n\r\n"]
[2.857326, "o", "    def spend(cid):\r\n"]
[2.977406, "o", "        return sum(order_total(o) for o in get_orders(cid))\r\n"]
[3.097651, "o", "    \r\n"]
[3.21764, "o", "    totals = {cid: spend(cid) for cid in list_customers()}\r\n"]
[3.338106, "o", "    best = max(totals, key=lambda c: totals[c])\r\n"]
[3.458458, "o", "    send_email(best, f\"Thanks! You spent ${totals[best]} with us.\")\r\n"]
[3.578433, "o", "    print(best, totals[best])\r\n"]
[3.698766, "o", "\r\nWeave runs it:\r\n"]
[5.305114, "o", "  wave 1 at 0.00s: 1 call  (list_customers)\r\n"]
[5.655808, "o", "  wave 2 at 0.30s: 4 calls together  (get_orders)\r\n"]
[6.006002, "o", "  wave 3 at 0.60s: 7 calls together  (order_total)\r\n"]
[6.356227, "o", "  wave 4 at 0.91s: 1 call  (send_email)\r\n"]
[6.706506, "o", "  output: c2 310\r\n"]
[7.006798, "o", "\r\nWeave:              1 model turn, 13 tool calls in 4 waves, 1.21 s\r\n"]
[7.307102, "o", "One call at a time: 13 round trips x 0.3 s = 3.9 s of tool time alone\r\n"]
[7.607251, "o", "Native parallel tool calls: a model turn per wave, 4 turns + the answer\r\n"]
[7.907531, "o", "\r\ndemo ok\r\n"]
